mber of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":212957,"global_rank":261917,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":42217},{"name":"AlexFox1777/Sprint-Challenge--Graphs","owner":"AlexFox1777","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexFox1777/Sprint-Challenge--Graphs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212953,"global_rank":261923,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":42218},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":212951,"global_rank":261926,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":42219},{"name":"aryann/docdrop","owner":"aryann","html_url":"https://github.com/aryann/docdrop","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212950,"global_rank":261934,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":42220},{"name":"MarcCharbo/time_server","owner":"MarcCharbo","html_url":"https://github.com/MarcCharbo/time_server","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":